t","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Delegation warning. The \"{0}\" part of this formula might not work correctly on large data sets."}},"properties":{"howToFix":["If your data set exceeds the 500 record limit but contains less than 2,000 records, try resetting the limit.","Try simplifying the formula.","Try moving your data to a different data source."],"whyFix":"","level":"Medium","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"formula"}},{"id":"app-ErrInvalidName","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Name isn't valid. '{0}' isn't recognized."}},"properties":{"howToFix":["Remove or correct the reference to the name that isn't valid."],"whyFix":"","level":"High","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"formula"}},{"id":"app-ErrInvalidArgs-Func","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"The function '{0}' has some invalid arguments."}},"properties":{"whyFix":"","level":"High","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"formula"}},{"id":"acc-AccessibleLabelNeeded","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Missing accessible label"}},"properties":{"howToFix":["Edit the accessible label property to describe the item."],"whyFix":"If there's no accessible text, people who can’t see the screen won't understand what’s in images and controls.","level":"Medium","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"accessibility"}},{"id":"acc-TabIndexShouldBeDefinedForInteractiveControl","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Missing tab stop"}},"properties":{"howToFix":["Set TabIndex to 0 or greater to ensure that interactive elements have a tab stop."],"whyFix":"People who use the keyboard with your app will not be able to access this element without a tab stop.","level":"Medium","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"accessibility"}},{"id":"app-UnusedVariables","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Unused variable"}},"properties":{"howToFix":["Remove the unused variable."],"whyFix":"This variable is declared but is not referenced by any control, so it is not needed.","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"performance","level":"Medium"}},{"id":"app-CrossScreenEventDependencies","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Event rule references a control on another screen"}},"properties":{"howToFix":["Move the work to an event on the owning screen (for example, Screen.OnVisible), or pass state between screens using Navigate's context parameter or a global variable and react to it on the target screen."],"whyFix":"Event rules (such as OnStart, OnVisible, and OnSelect) that reference controls on other screens force those screens to load and initialize early, even if the user never navigates to them. This can noticeably slow app start-up and navigation.","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"performance","level":"Medium"}}]}},"invocations":[{"executionSuccessful":true}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits"}]}